<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xsd:schema xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
	targetNamespace="http://ei/core/driverx1">
	<xsd:complexType name="Driver">
		<xsd:sequence>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverSequenceNumber"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains a unique sequence number assigned to the driver, which remains the same during the life of a policy.  

</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverName"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains name of a driver.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverBirthDate"
				type="xsd:date"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains contains the birth date of the driver.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverMaritalStatusCode"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the code that identifies the marital status of the driver.
Valid options for this element are: 'S'- Single, 'D' - Divorced, 'M'-Married, 'W'-Widowed, or spaces.
</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverOperatorCode"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains a code that identifies if the driver is a principal or non-principal operator of the vehicle they are assigned to.
Valid options for this element are 'P'-Principal or 'N' - Non-Principal.

</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DrivingRecordCode"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains a code that indentifies the number or years driving experience without a claim.

</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverLicenseNumber"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the number issued by a state's Department of Motor Vehicle for a driver’s license.

</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverLicensedDate"
				type="xsd:date"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the date when the individual became a licensed driver.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0"
				name="DriverPostalStateAbbreviation" type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the abbreviation of the state or province where the principal driver's license was issued.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverGenderCode"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains a code that identifies the gender of the driver.
Valid options for this element are 'F'-Female or 'M'-Male.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0"
				name="NumberOfDriverEligibilityPoints" type="xsd:integer"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the number of eligibility points for the driver.  Eligibility points are given include points for inexperience operator, chargeable accidents and motor vehicle points.
</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0"
				name="NumberOfBodilyInjuryAtFaultAccidents" type="xsd:integer"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the number of at fault accidents which have resulted in bodily injury for the preceding three years.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0"
				name="NumberOfPropertyDamageAtFaultAccidents" type="xsd:integer"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the number of at fault accidents which have resulted in damage to properly only for the preceding three years.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0"
				name="NumberOfWaivedStandardViolationPoints" type="xsd:integer"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the number of automobile violation points which were waived in the pricing of the policy for the driver.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverLicenseCountryCode"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element is a code for a country, nation or political state where the Driver's license was issued.
The E1T00101 Corporate Table contains valid values for this element in the &quot;CNTRY_C&quot; column.

</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DriverLicenseCopyIndicator"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element specifies whether a copy of the driver's license was submitted.
Valid options for this element are 'Y' or 'N'
</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
		</xsd:sequence>
	</xsd:complexType>
</xsd:schema>
